The entropy/Bochner chain uses: ∫ |∇f|² dvol = -∫ f Δ f dvol, or ∫ Δf dvol = 0, or ∫ div(X) dvol = 0. The Bochner chain: Δ|∇f|² etc. The entropy chain: ∫ f Δ f = -∫|∇f|². In a chart with metric g: Δ_g f = (1/√det g) ∂_i (√det g g^{ij} ∂_j f). IBP with compact support: ∫ f Δ_g f dvol = -∫ g^{ij} ∂_i f ∂_j f dvol = -∫ |∇f|²_g dvol.

